A return visit?  


Roselyn was stunned but quickly regained her composure. Years of etiquette training took over, and she accepted the invitation with practiced grace.  


“If you would do me that honor, it would be my pleasure.”  


“How about next Thursday?”  


“That sounds perfect. I will make the necessary preparations.”  


