Roselyn Eleanor Fairfield, 24 years old. The eldest daughter of Viscount Andover, effectively managing the household. She had two younger brothers and one younger sister, all with good reputations. Viscount Alfred Fairfield was an average noble, responsible with finances and respectable in social circles.  


